[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C10_INDEPENDENCE]
Independence Movement

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C10_INDEPENDENCE_desc]
A time of challenge could also be a time of opportunity. Independence movements are on the rise, and the world is changing. The question is, will you be the pony to change it?

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C10_INDEPENDENCE]
独立运动

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C10_INDEPENDENCE_desc]
一个充满挑战的时代也是一个充满机遇的时代。独立运动正在兴起，世界正在改变。问题是，你会是那个改变者吗？
